</section>
<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>Implementation and Hyperparameter Details</h2>

<div id="A8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Our model was trained using the configuration and hyperparameters summarized in Table <a href="#A8.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ Appendix H Implementation and Hyperparameter Details ‣ Visual Programmability: A Guide for Code-as-Thought in Chart Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>. We used the EasyR1 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib68" title="" class="ltx_ref">68</a>]</cite> framework for our reinforcement learning implementation. The base model, Qwen2.5-VL-7B, was trained for 200 episodes. The vision tower of the model remained frozen during training to preserve its pre-trained perceptual capabilities.</p>
</div>
